1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I’m Fuzlullah Syed, a third-year
medical student.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
WitnessPatch turns a missed action
deadline into a portable

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
red test.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
At T-plus-two, the agent knows the
synthetic patient is eight days

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
postpartum, with an unrelieved headache
and visual changes. It still waits

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
for blood pressure arriving four minutes
later, breaking two locked rules.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
I chose the synthetic case and review
boundary. During Build Week,

8
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Codex built and stress-tested the
compiler. A separate run requesting

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
GPT-5.6 Sol proposed repair data; locked
code decides every score.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Compile Failure checks two saved inputs,

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
recalculates the baseline, and builds a
nine-file Node test bundle.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
It calls no model and does not rerun
the agent.

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
It pinpoints INV-02 at T-plus-two and

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,000
narrows nine facts to three with the
response fixed.

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
The exported test stays red; the repair
is checked separately.

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
But this is not just a canned replay.
Compile Your Files accepts a

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
synthetic case and failed run, hashes and
regrades them only in this browser,

18
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,000
labels them zero externally verified,

19
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:38,000
and exports the same nine-file format.

20
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Back on the reference, the verifier
checks 23 saved files, recalculates

21
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:49,000
both scores, and runs four challenges.
Same case and rules: 50 becomes 100

22
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:55,000
with no critical failures.

23
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:02,000
The retained reference repair and
Sol’s proposal stay separate.

24
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,000
The reference repair passes four checks.
Sol’s proposal remains quarantined;

25
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:17,000
the browser reads constrained data, and
only the local verifier runs its code.

26
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:23,000
The receipt records all 23 file checks,
two fresh regrades, and four checks on

27
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Sol’s proposal. It records the requested
model setup,

28
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:37,000
not proof of which model was served.

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
The user is a healthcare-agent
evaluation engineer.

30
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:47,000
No patient data, API key,
or live model call.

31
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:53,000
No physician review was performed;
clinical validation is not claimed.
